FFmpeg headers
--------------

internal/libav/include/ holds the public headers of FFmpeg
(https://ffmpeg.org), copied unmodified from an FFmpeg build at revision
e2bc6d88cd68184288c16570e04881c3a426a05a (FFMPEG_VERSION
"N-125841-ge2bc6d88cd" in libavutil/ffversion.h). They are part of FFmpeg
and remain under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or (at
your option) any later version. The license text is in
COPYING.LGPLv2.1. The BSD-3-Clause license above does not apply to them.

FFmpeg source for that revision:
https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/tree/e2bc6d88cd68184288c16570e04881c3a426a05a

FFmpeg libraries
----------------

goffmpeg links prebuilt FFmpeg libraries published separately as
github.com/belluikit/goffmpeg-libs. That build has no --enable-gpl and no
--enable-nonfree, so those libraries are LGPL v2.1 or later; their exact
version, configure line and source location are in goffmpeg-libs' NOTICE
files. A program that links them is a "work that uses the Library" under
the LGPL v2.1 and must meet its section 6 conditions when distributed.
